  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SBA Urban JV Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity investment of up to EUR 30 million in UAB Urban Hub Holding (&quot;Urban  Hub Holding&quot;), a limited liability company incorporated in Lithuania, which  will act as a joint venture (the &quot;JV&quot;) between the Bank and UAB SBA Urban (the  &quot;Sponsor&quot; or &quot;SBA Urban&quot;). The JV will invest across the Baltic States and  (potentially) CEE in a platform of small business unit / last mile logistics  projects (the &quot;Project&quot;) comprised of retail, logistics and office spaces.  The EBRD&apos;s investment will enable the development of a number of small business  unit / last mile logistics projects in the Baltic States and CEE countries.</narrative>
  </description>
